      "side": 1,
      "message": "fsfdt change wouldn\u0027t be necessary if all of following happens.\n  - Only take \u0027loading from path\u0027 up to 1.\n  - loading from path comes before untrusted props appending.\n\nMy suggestion wouldn\u0027t work if we need to load from multiple path or `/proc/device-tree/avf/reference/untrusted/` exists, but it wouldn\u0027t happen.\n\nSo, again, let\u0027s not allow to add multiple dt_additions. Just change this signature to `create_device_tree_overlay(buffer: \u0026mut [u8], base_fs_dir: \u0026Path, untrusted_props: \u0026[(\u0026Cstr, \u0026[u8])])` (ommiting lifetime)",
